{"id":18590,"author":"faht","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eMy name is Adam, i'm 13 years old and lives in Sweden.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eI bought minecraft in June 2013. I joined McZone about 3 years ago but I became active when I got banned on OCN, around 2 years ago.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eI'm currently in Bad Company, which Tazz's leading. I got accepted to Bad Company about 1 and a half year ago, when bmbrocks321 aka BmB was the leader.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI became Junior Moderator 3rd of October and got promoted to Moderator 18th of October. I became Junior MapDev 1st of November and got promoted to MapDev 21st of November. I'm also an Official, I got promoted 29th of November.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eI will answer all questions and I'll be 100% honest.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eMy name is Adam, i'm 13 years old and lives in Sweden.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eI bought minecraft in June 2013. I joined McZone about 3 years ago but I became active when I got banned on OCN, around 2 years ago.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eI'm currently in Bad Company, which Tazz's leading. I got accepted to Bad Company about 1 and a half year ago, when bmbrocks321 aka BmB was the leader.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI became Junior Moderator 3rd of October and got promoted to Moderator 18th of October. I became Junior MapDev 1st of November and got promoted to MapDev 21st of November. I'm also an Official, I got promoted 29th of November.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eI will answer all questions and I'll be 100% honest.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1449394261,"title":"[AMA] Jiveh","replies":[{"id":255284,"author":"Tynvale","body":"\u